The git repository [1] and the bug tracker [2] for Babeltrace, a project which
provides trace read and write libraries, as well as a trace converter,
have been moved to the Linux Foundation's servers. The previous bug
database is in the process of being migrated from Redmine to
Bugzilla. In the meantime, you can still access the old bug tracker [3].

Thanks,

